{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"happy Valentine!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が終わってしまった〜〜；"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/02/15/5677380/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けれども←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんチョコは食べましたかー??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男性はチョコ苦手なひともいるのかな??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子もたくさん食べたんじゃないかな?......(笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな私も大量の糖分を摂取しましたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/02/15/5677380/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんにもチョコあげたいけど出来ない事実......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/02/15/5677380/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど、私のキモチ......\nアナタの心に届いてるといいなぁ?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/02/15/5677380/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何て言ってみました!HAHAHAHA"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコへ代わる甘いプレゼントになった??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ以上甘い台詞はご勘弁を〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これでもむっちゃ恥ずかしいんだよぉぉぉ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(-_-)ちーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、コメントにちょこちょこ書いてありましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたくし人生初カラーリングしました!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の黒髪が好きだと言って下さる方々の存在は知っていて、どうしようかすごーく悩みました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/02/15/5677380/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど、自分なりに色々考えてちょっとイメチェン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、明るくするのは本当に少しだけにしたから、TVとかではあまり極端には変わっていないはず。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私自身も黒髪大好きだし、また黒髪に戻す時もあると思いますが、一先ず今はこの色を楽しもうと思います♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は桜井玲香の色々な面を、もっと皆さんにお見せしていきたいんだっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/02/15/5677380/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと皆さんに魅力的だと思ってもらえるようになりたいから、\n色々試してみて、自分に合うスタイルを見つけようと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/02/15/5677380/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/02/15/5677380/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/02/15/5677380/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新制服と髪型似合ってるかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/02/15/5677380/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"???"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"P.S."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの大学お祝いコメント\nありがとうございました!\n両立頑張るから見ててね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog